/*
  v12
  WRO consistency v11 -- RUMBA / Arduino Mega, AccelStepper + Servo.

  DEFAULT: short diagnostic route, not the competition route.
  Confirm pins, direction, gearing and both drivers' microstep settings first.
  Set RUN_FULL_ROUTE true only after repeatable straight and turn calibration.

  One AccelStepper FUNCTION trajectory clocks BOTH wheels. Integer DDA distributes
  unequal calibrated pulse totals throughout that trajectory. Driver STEP edges
  are emitted together when both wheels are due; no two independent ramps.
  Position is a count of commanded pulses, NOT measured wheel/robot position.
  A stall, tyre slip or loose hub requires physical correction or feedback.
*/
